gcuy(){return"Six parts can cost points: order trend (up to 40: no orders, or orders falling against the week or month before), sign-ins and activity (up to 20: nobody signing in, or orders on very few days), billing (up to 45: locked, paused, cancellation scheduled, past due, or a trial about to end with no plan chosen), setup (up to 10: the checklist is not finished), feature breadth (up to 5: only one or two parts of the product in use) and card payments (up to 5: Fold Pay charges failing)."},
gcuB(){return"A store under 14 days old has no order trend to read, so it is scored on setup progress instead: 7 points for each of the four checklist steps not done. Order trend and feature breadth are not scored for it."},
